This project reads and writes documents produced by DocuWorks (FUJIFILM
Business Innovation, formerly Fuji Xerox). It is not affiliated with or
endorsed by FUJIFILM Business Innovation Corp. "DocuWorks" is a trademark of
FUJIFILM Business Innovation Corp.

The format was worked out from public sample files (corpus/manifest.tsv) and by
writing test files and opening them in the free DocuWorks Viewer Light.
No DocuWorks software or SDK is used or shipped.

Reference only (no code copied):
  - xdw-salvage (The Unlicense): read for comparison while checking findings.
  - xdwlib (Apache-2.0): documents the DocuWorks API names.

